    "detailed_description": "<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475640/extras/f3622f4cb58d2bd3d7fc9bea60c97a3b.avif?t=1726167611\" /></span><br>Yo, oh my god man. I'm so glad you asked. Homeless Guy is a side-scrolling comedy RPG sandbox game made by two guys. Make money, commit crime, and distort reality. With a singleplayer campaign, multiplayer, and countless collectibles, the game's open-ended nature with multiple paths is designed to keep you exploring. You explore a town, a city, and more to come with incremental updates in Early Access. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475640/extras/65fb10b5ed3d505420fb4420b0680402.avif?t=1726167611\" /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475640/extras/6adbcbcf3a30ef32cf0f9d86d8e86b93.avif?t=1726167611\" /></span><br><br>Explore an open-world campaign with up to 4 players. Treat the world like your sandbox, or create new games entirely. Drive vehicles, help citizens, rob banks, or just hang out.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475640/extras/c68c6891fb19d6fbf2717910452b86f6.avif?t=1726167611\" /></span><br><br>Follow the game's progress on the .",
